# ===== Dependencies =====
node_modules/

# ===== Android build artifacts =====
android/.gradle/
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/local.properties
android/**/*.iml
android/.idea/

# ===== iOS (future-proof; not present yet) =====
ios/

# ===== Capacitor / native build outputs =====
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks

# ===== Logs & OS cruft =====
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== WorkBuddy / editor internal =====
.workbuddy/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ===== 开发期临时脚本 / 中间产物 =====
# 调试时会在根目录写 _ta.js / _tn.js / _ab.json 这类脚本，跑完就该删。
# 2026-09-21 有一次清理没跑成，结果被 `git add -A` 误提交（aeee498）——
# 加这条规则兜底，避免再犯。
_*.js
_*.py
_*.json
_*.md
